WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.130 --> 00:00:06.658
At Orchard Fold, the maple shades the reading chair. So why did this fictional conservatory overheat?

2
00:00:07.030 --> 00:00:14.455
Follow the sun on the survey. At half past twelve in June, the rays clear both trees and pour through the glass roof.

3
00:00:14.730 --> 00:00:18.572
The maple catches the sun at half past four, hours too late.

4
00:00:18.830 --> 00:00:24.773
We replaced the glass roof, upgraded the glazing and added outside screens and cross-ventilation.

5
00:00:25.030 --> 00:00:31.464
In the modelled year, occupied hours above twenty-six degrees fell from sixteen hundred and sixty-seven to zero.

6
00:00:31.730 --> 00:00:37.213
Winter needed a different fix: heating before breakfast. Six cold hours remained.

7
00:00:37.930 --> 00:00:41.749
Here’s the finished room. Explore the full study in the demo.
